\q2 \w and keep you|strong="H8104"\w*;
\q1 \v 25 \w may the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w cause His face|strong="H6440"\w* \w to shine|strong="H215"\w* \w upon you|strong="H413"\w*
\q2 \w and be gracious to you|strong="H2603"\w*;
