\p \v 21 \w But Moses|strong="H4872"\w* \w replied|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Here I am|strong="H595"\w* \w among|strong="H7130"\w* \w 600,000|strong="H8337"\w* \w men|strong="H5971"\w* \w on foot|strong="H7273"\w*, \w yet You|strong="H859"\w* \w say|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w I will give|strong="H5414"\w* them \w meat|strong="H1320"\w*, \w and they will eat|strong="H398"\w* \w for a month|strong="H2320"\w*.’ \v 22 \w If all our flocks|strong="H6629"\w* \w and herds|strong="H1241"\w* \w were slaughtered|strong="H7819"\w* for them, \w would they have enough|strong="H4672"\w*? \w Or if|strong="H518"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the fish|strong="H1709"\w* \w in the sea|strong="H3220"\w* \w were caught|strong="H622"\w* for them, \w would they have enough|strong="H4672"\w*?”
\p \v 23 \w The LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w answered|strong="H559"\w* \w Moses|strong="H4872"\w*, “\w Is the LORD’s|strong="H3068"\w* \w arm|strong="H3027"\w* \w too short|strong="H7114"\w*? \w Now|strong="H6258"\w* \w you will see|strong="H7200"\w* \w whether or|strong="H518"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w My word|strong="H1697"\w* \w will come to pass|strong="H7136"\w*.”
