\p \v 31 \w So Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w lived|strong="H3427"\w* \w in the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of the Amorites|strong="H567"\w*. \v 32 \w After Moses|strong="H4872"\w* \w had sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w spies|strong="H7270"\w* \w to Jazer|strong="H3270"\w*, \w Israel captured|strong="H3920"\w* \w its villages|strong="H1323"\w* \w and drove out|strong="H3423"\w* \w the Amorites|strong="H567"\w* \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w were there|strong="H8033"\w*.
