\s1 The Tribe of Judah
\p \v 19 \w The sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w were Er|strong="H6147"\w* \w and Onan|strong="H209"\w*, \w but they|strong="H6147"\w* \w died|strong="H4191"\w* \w in the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Canaan|strong="H3667"\w*. \v 20 \w These were|strong="H1961"\w* \w the descendants|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w by their clans|strong="H4940"\w*:
