\s1 Inheritance by Lot
\p \v 52 \w Then the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w said|strong="H1696"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Moses|strong="H4872"\w*, \v 53 “\w The land|strong="H776"\w* \w is to be divided|strong="H2505"\w* \w among the tribes|strong="H428"\w* \w as an inheritance|strong="H5159"\w*, \w according to the number|strong="H4557"\w* \w of names|strong="H8034"\w*. \v 54 \w Increase|strong="H7235"\w* \w the inheritance|strong="H5159"\w* \w for a large tribe|strong="H7227"\w* \w and decrease|strong="H4591"\w* \w it|strong="H5159"\w* \w for a small one|strong="H4592"\w*; \w each tribe|strong="H376"\w* \w is to receive|strong="H5414"\w* \w its inheritance|strong="H5159"\w* \w according to|strong="H6310"\w* \w the number of those registered|strong="H6485"\w*.
